# S19: Sprint Analytics Dashboard

## Objective

A `/dashboard` page in work-control that shows cross-sprint metrics:
task velocity, gate-open latency (time from OPEN → OPEN → done), agent
efficiency (mock vs LLM speed), epic acceptance rate. Sourced from `wc_activity`
(already populated since S05). No new DB tables — SQL aggregation only.

## Features

- Velocity chart: tasks completed per day/week (sparkline)
- Gate timing histogram: OPEN → OPEN median, OPEN → done median
- Agent efficiency table: per-role avg task duration
- Epic funnel: proposed → accepted → rejected rates
- Per-board summary card
- Export: JSON (CSV via `Content-Disposition: attachment`)

